#==============================================================================================
#
#   transformation_style_value_1 - TransformationStyleValue: a transform function and its matrix
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/TransformationStyleValue.cpp (lines 1-382) and the inline
#       members of TransformationStyleValue.h: creation, the identity transform functions and
#       to_matrix (its `length_to_px` and `get_value` lambdas are functions of their own taking the
#       captures as parameters). Gfx::VectorN's length() and normalized(), which gfx does not port
#       yet, are the css_float_vector3_* helpers.
